GET http://localhost:8080/hello

### Register: returns access_token and refresh_token right away
POST {{local}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anton.zeltser@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token); %}

### Login
POST {{local}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anton.zeltser@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token); %}

### Logout: revokes the token from the last register/login
POST {{local}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
